ffmpeg/ffprobe sidecars land here, named with their target triple:

  ffmpeg-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.exe
  ffprobe-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.exe
  ffmpeg-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
  ffprobe-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu

Run ./scripts/fetch-ffmpeg.sh to download them. They are gitignored on purpose:
the binaries are large and carry their own (GPL) license.
